title Cassette with the longest real label name (WEEKLY MEETING WITH THE TEAM 12, 31 characters, all capitals): two lines on the label, no ruled line through them, the info box still one codec line over the time left
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CODEC opus:128
env CASSETTE_DEMO_NAME "WEEKLY MEETING WITH THE TEAM 12"
env CASSETTE_DEMO_LEFT "955 h"
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot name-two-small
expect esc
expect notext "SIDE A"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
